 "اِدّاࣰ‏", "translit": "", "root": ""}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 19, "ayah": 90, "text": "يَكَادُ اُ۬لسَّمَٰوَٰتُ يَتَفَطَّرْنَ مِنْهُ وَتَنشَقُّ اُ۬لَارْضُ وَتَخِرُّ اُ۬لْجِبَالُ هَدّاً", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَكَادُ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "اُ۬لسَّمَٰوَٰتُ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "يَتَفَطَّرْنَ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "مِنْهُ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَتَنشَقُّ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "اُ۬لَارْضُ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 7, "arabic": "وَتَخِرُّ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 8, "arabic": "اُ۬لْجِبَالُ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 9, "arabic": "هَدّاً", "translit": "", "root": ""}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 19, "ayah": 91, "text": "اَن دَعَوْاْ لِلرَّحْمَٰنِ وَلَداࣰۖ", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "اَن", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "دَعَوْاْ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِلرَّحْمَٰنِ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "وَلَداࣰۖ", "translit": "", "root": ""}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 19, "ayah": 92, "text": "وَمَا يَنۢبَغِے لِلرَّحْمَٰنِ أَنْ يَّتَّخِذَ وَلَداًۖ", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَنۢبَغِے", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "لِلرَّحْمَٰنِ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "أَنْ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "يَّتَّخِذَ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "وَلَداًۖ", "translit": "", "root": ""}], "narration": "warsh"}, {"surah": 19, "ayah": 93, "text": "اِن كُلُّ مَن فِے اِ۬لسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَالَارْضِ إِلَّآ ءَاتِے اِ۬لرَّحْمَٰنِ عَبْداࣰۖ", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "اِن", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كُلُّ", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَن", "translit": "", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "فِے", "translit": "", "root": ""}